Locale data source:           @source@
Locale data origin:           @origin@
Locale data libc version:     @libc_version@
Locale data Unicode version:  @unicode_version@
Locale data upstream version: @package_version@
Locale data upstream URL:     @package_url@

Destination for bare locales: @prefix@/lib/locale.@origin@
Destination for modifiers:    @prefix@/lib/locale@@origin@
System locale path:           @system_locale_path@

install.sh                    compile and install locales
uninstall.sh                  remove installed locales
select.sh                     add/remove locales with modifiers to system path